{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence","doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/SegmentStore"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/SegmentStore\/dropReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/persistence\/segmentstore\/dropreports"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Persistence"}],"externalID":"s:11Persistence12SegmentStoreV11dropReports11AsyncQueues0F5QueueVyAA10DropReportOGvp","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Persistence\/SegmentStore.swift#L212","fileName":"SegmentStore.swift"},"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence10DropReportO","text":"DropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"title":"dropReports"},"abstract":[{"text":"A report of each drop, in the order they happen, from recovery onwards.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"DropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence10DropReportO","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/DropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait, without a bound, until they are read, so none is missed by reading late."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Drops are rare (each is a whole segment, or bytes recovery couldn’t read), so they don’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pile up. The sequence ends once the store is gone and every report has been read."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A reader cancelled while it waits returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence/SegmentStore/dropReports":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each drop, in the order they happen, from recovery onwards."}],"url":"\/documentation\/persistence\/segmentstore\/dropreports","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"DropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence10DropReportO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"title":"dropReports","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/SegmentStore\/dropReports"},"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence/RecordStore":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where a tracker keeps each record until it is delivered, so records survive the app ending."}],"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RecordStore","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RecordStore","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore","title":"RecordStore","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/persistence\/recordstore","role":"symbol"},"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Keep each record on disk until it is delivered, so the records a tracker tracked survive the app ending.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/persistence","role":"collection","title":"Persistence","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence"},"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Elements in the order they are enqueued, kept until they are read; one reader at a time reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","type":"topic","title":"AsyncQueue","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence/DropReport":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DropReport","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Records a store dropped before they were delivered, and why.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/persistence\/dropreport","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DropReport","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"DropReport","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/DropReport"},"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence/SegmentStore":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" that keeps records in a directory of append-only segment files, bounded in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"size, until they are delivered."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SegmentStore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SegmentStore"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/SegmentStore","kind":"symbol","title":"SegmentStore","url":"\/documentation\/persistence\/segmentstore","role":"symbol"}}}